{
  "nodes": [
    {"id":"grp-sources","type":"group","label":"SOURCES (registration required; raw files git-ignored)","x":-2160,"y":-560,"width":460,"height":800},
    {"id":"n-hfd","type":"text","text":"**Human Fertility Database**\nhumanfertility.org\n\n`asfrRR.txt` — bulk zip, build 2026-07-02\n39 populations · Lexis squares (ACY)\nNOR/USA → 2024 · DNK → 2025\nKOR 2000–2024 (new)","x":-2120,"y":-520,"width":380,"height":230,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"n-hfc","type":"text","text":"**Human Fertility Collection**\nfertilitydata.org\n\n`HFC_ASFRstand_TOT` — build 2026-07-07\nFills pre-HFD years + HFC-only pops\n(AUS, BIH, MDA, MKD, NZL → 2024/25;\nALB 2008 · GRC/LVA 2009 · ROU 2013 stale)","x":-2120,"y":-260,"width":380,"height":250,"color":"3"},
    {"id":"n-terms","type":"text","text":"⚖️ **Terms note**: raw HFD/HFC not redistributed; combined derived CSV committed (2016 precedent). 2020 findings **reproducible** from frozen in-repo data, **not replicable** from fresh downloads (sources revise).","x":-2120,"y":20,"width":380,"height":190,"color":"1"},

    {"id":"n-ingest","type":"text","text":"**`scripts/ingest_2026.R`**\n\nCombination rules (as published 2020):\n- HFD ≻ HFC per country-year\n- within HFC: STAT ≻ ODE ≻ RE\n- internal gaps ≤ 4 yr → linear interp, flagged\n\n⚠️ **FRATNP → FRA fix**: old build silently dropped HFD France → published figures ended France at 2008; restored to 1892–2023","x":-1600,"y":-460,"width":360,"height":330,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"n-valid","type":"text","text":"**Validation**\n`reports/validation_2026.md`\n\n148k overlap cells audited vs 2016 build — all discrepancies explained (HFD back-revisions: IRL, ESP, DNK; KOR source switch). **Build accepted.**","x":-1600,"y":-80,"width":360,"height":200,"color":"1"},
    {"id":"n-tag","type":"text","text":"📌 **Tag provenance**\n`demres-2020` (on GitHub) = full repo state + data behind the published 2020 paper — readers can return to it from the paper's link. The 2020-vintage panels of the forecast-check figure are re-rendered **from tag data**.\n\nA further **archive tag** freezes the repo at submission (F-026).","x":-1600,"y":170,"width":360,"height":280,"color":"1"},

    {"id":"n-csv","type":"text","text":"**Combined dataset**\n`data/data_combined_and_standardised_2026.csv`\n51 populations · 168,099 rows · 1850–2025\n\n→ `prepare_dta_2026()` (`functions_2026.R`): CPFR + pseudo-cohort CCFR, `series_ok`, published exclusions → **45-country panel**","x":-1160,"y":-380,"width":380,"height":270,"color":"5"},
    {"id":"n-exante","type":"text","text":"📌 **Ex-ante analytic choices** (fixed in `UPDATE_WORKPLAN.md` before running on updated data)\n\n- **ANR**: highest age with ASFR ≥ **1/200** (sensitivity 1/1000)\n- **AAPF**: argmax of schedule, ties → youngest age\n- *never* = observed past 44 without crossing 2.05; else *censored*\n- per-country trajectories primary; pooled medians context","x":-1160,"y":-60,"width":380,"height":310,"color":"1"},

    {"id":"grp-analysis","type":"group","label":"ANALYSIS — runway quantities & forecast check","x":-680,"y":-620,"width":520,"height":1240},
    {"id":"n-2x2","type":"text","text":"**Forecast check** `forecast_check_2x2_2026.R`\n+ `extract_2018_extrapolation.py`\n2020-vintage (from tag) vs 2026 panels; 2018 drawn extrapolations **digitized from the PNG** (QC overlay + CSV); true field contours — vertical escapes render (F-028)","x":-640,"y":-580,"width":440,"height":230,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"n-wall","type":"text","text":"**ANR** `wall_2026.R`\nper country-year, both thresholds → `wall_by_country_year.csv` · featured walls (NOR/USA/KOR) · reachability · `last_cohort_replacement.csv`","x":-640,"y":-310,"width":440,"height":170,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"n-squeeze","type":"text","text":"**AAPF + squeeze** `squeeze_2026.R`\n→ `squeeze_by_country_year.csv` · 45-panel figure ordered by **vintage-adjusted latest TFR** (panel-median correction for 9 pre-2022 series; F-034/F-035) → `latest_tfr_by_country.csv`","x":-640,"y":-100,"width":440,"height":200,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"n-pooled","type":"text","text":"**Pooled squeeze** `squeeze_pooled_2026.R`\ncross-country medians + IQR ribbons, usable-runway arrows","x":-640,"y":140,"width":440,"height":120,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"n-3d","type":"text","text":"**3D terrain** `lexis_3d_ridge_2026.R`\nFrance/Norway/South Korea 3×2: ASFR terrain (AAPF cells magenta) beside each AAPF trajectory (F-027/F-028)","x":-640,"y":300,"width":440,"height":150,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"n-lattice","type":"text","text":"**Lattice panels** `figures_2026.R` → 45-country splits (S1) · **US plateau** `us_plateau_2026.R` → S8","x":-640,"y":490,"width":440,"height":110,"color":"2"},

