    {"id":"n-results","type":"text","text":"**Headline results**\n- 2020 forecasts resolved: both **qualitatively correct, quantitatively optimistic** — Norway's contour escapes immediately after cohort 1971 (a decade of cohorts sooner than drawn); USA crossings continue to cohort 1984 but at ages 39–40 not 37, censored beyond — verdict open\n- Every terminal crossing since 1970 (bar Albania) at ages 40–44 → a common boundary the extrapolations treated as open space\n- **ANR is behavioural, nearly fixed**: 47–48 (C19th) → 41 (1980s–90s) → 43 (2020s); tail movement ART-propped, socioeconomically stratified\n- **AAPF**: age 24 → 31; rate at peak 0.19 → 0.11\n- **Usable runway**: ~20 yrs → **12 yrs** — later, lower, narrower everywhere; TFR convergence is its one-dimensional shadow\n- 43/45 countries: post-war cohorts past 44 that never crossed 2.05","x":-80,"y":140,"width":940,"height":480,"color":"4"},

    {"id":"grp-artifacts","type":"group","label":"THREE COORDINATED ARTIFACTS (F-025)","x":940,"y":-620,"width":500,"height":1240},
    {"id":"n-a1","type":"text","text":"**Artifact 1 — the repository** (this one, public on GitHub)\nAgentic updating under author direction: decision log fixed ex ante · feedback register `review/FEEDBACK.md` **F-001..F-035** (incl. Gemini Pro review round F-029..F-033, verbatim in `review/model_review_2026-07-20.md`) · `REVISIONS.md` changelog · tags for return points","x":980,"y":-580,"width":420,"height":290,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"n-a2","type":"text","text":"**Artifact 2 — main manuscript**\n`manuscript_2026/closing_corridor_merged.qmd`\n*Running out of runway: fertility trends for 45 countries revisited* (title provisional)\n\nSpine: renewed interest → 2020 method → limited uptake → the 2020 annotations WERE predictions → checked: right direction, optimistic → TFR debate needs age structure → AAPF/ANR formalised → the squeeze\n\nFigures: 3D terrain · forecast-check 2×2 · Norway wall · pooled squeeze · 45-panel squeeze (TFR-ordered)","x":980,"y":-240,"width":420,"height":430,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"n-a3","type":"text","text":"**Artifact 3 — supplement** `supplementary_materials.qmd`\nS1 45-country lattice panels · S2 featured walls (USA censored, KOR) · S3 panel-ordering record (vintage adjustment) · S4 ANR sensitivity 1/1000 · S5 candidate geometries & mimics · S6 COVID as texture · S7 2018 extrapolation provenance · S8 vanished US plateau","x":980,"y":240,"width":420,"height":280,"color":"6"},

    {"id":"n-prereg","type":"text","text":"**Feeds forward → universality test** (separate, confirmatory)\nOSF prereg [osf.io/j3tbq](https://osf.io/j3tbq) frozen 12 Jul 2026 *before* outcome data download · UN WPP 2024 global panel · break dates, age-gradient onset, tempo guards · this paper runs none of its estimators","x":1500,"y":-240,"width":400,"height":270,"color":"5"},
